{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anomaly President is here with its unique presidential rogue-like gameplay where you can destroy your enemies in the craziest ways!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the mission to overthrow a president pushing the world toward disaster. But fighting is not enough. To save the world, you must also run for presidency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156330/extras/5b9d2ae221e2ace3fbb6c9ef627b3b70.poster.avif?t=1755076739\" width=600 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156330/extras/5b9d2ae221e2ace3fbb6c9ef627b3b70.webm?t=1755076739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEADLY WARRIOR BY NIGHT, PRESIDENTIAL CANDIDATE BY DAY</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead a double life in a world of chaos and corruption. By day, you're a presidential candidate, winning the hearts and minds of the people. By night, you transform into a vigilante warrior, using your weapons to take down the criminal gangs controlled by the current president. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world filled with anomalies, you will encounter various enemies and vice president bosses, each with their own unique anomaly power. For example, did you know the president's PR chief has the power of HEART, making people fall in love with them?! The good news is, by defeating these bosses, you can acquire their anomaly powers! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156330/extras/34fa4ba65a8442fe89c0f243ef28f1b4.poster.avif?t=1755076739\" width=600 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156330/extras/34fa4ba65a8442fe89c0f243ef28f1b4.webm?t=1755076739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>YOU CAN'T BECOME PRESIDENT BY YOURSELF; YOU NEED A TEAM</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need a trustworthy team to run campaigns and empower you on your path to presidency. Choosing the right team is crucial in Anomaly President! They'll be the ones to help you win the race!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156330/extras/39f26a13e780d9cd579b6587cb426a9c.poster.avif?t=1755076739\" width=600 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156330/extras/39f26a13e780d9cd579b6587cb426a9c.webm?t=1755076739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit the oppressed Fluffies to fight for their rights by joining your team. You can assign them to different departments: some will campaign for you during elections, others will upgrade your equipment, and some will assist you in battles. But remember if you want to benefit from them, you need to take good care of them. Otherwise, they might abandon you or worse, lose their lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>YOU NEED A BASE ON YOUR JOURNEY TO PRESIDENCY</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To combat hidden crime syndicates and also run your presidential campaign simultaneously, you need a base that moves with you. Enter the campaign bus! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your campaign bus to suit your style and needs! Start from scratch, add unique sections, and create a personalized mobile base for your campaign.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156330/extras/32ef5deca71091727ad88854eafc7596.poster.avif?t=1755076739\" width=600 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156330/extras/32ef5deca71091727ad88854eafc7596.webm?t=1755076739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHOOSE YOUR WEAPON AND ANOMALY POWER!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special anomaly upgrades you'll encounter while fighting will shape your warrior identity. You can become a sword master who parries enemies at the right time or transform into a cyber mage dealing mass damage with anomaly powers. In Anomaly President, the choices are plenty! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The best part is, the rogue-like structure lets you experiment with all options. Try out different powers and progress with the one that best suits your style! There are many ways to evolve in Anomaly President. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156330/extras/5fa4f11009c5ed8a89d11462d0e858b5.poster.avif?t=1755076739\" width=600 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156330/extras/5fa4f11009c5ed8a89d11462d0e858b5.webm?t=1755076739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ANOMALY PRESIDENT WANTS YOU!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel the country, explore new horizons, win the people's hearts, destroy the current president's gangs, liberate the people from tyranny, and ultimately get your revenge! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anomaly President is calling you to action!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3156330?t=1755076739","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156330/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755076739","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156330/f957d6832a5f21f89a1e77cb4204b409a8b3143c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755076739","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156330/f957d6832a5f21f89a1e77cb4204b409a8b3143c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755076739","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anomaly President is here with its unique presidential rogue-like gameplay where you can destroy your enemies in the craziest ways!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on the mission to overthrow a president pushing the world toward disaster. But fighting is not enough. To save the world, you must also run for presidency.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156330/extras/5b9d2ae221e2ace3fbb6c9ef627b3b70.poster.avif?t=1755076739\" width=600 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156330/extras/5b9d2ae221e2ace3fbb6c9ef627b3b70.webm?t=1755076739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEADLY WARRIOR BY NIGHT, PRESIDENTIAL CANDIDATE BY DAY</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lead a double life in a world of chaos and corruption. By day, you're a presidential candidate, winning the hearts and minds of the people. By night, you transform into a vigilante warrior, using your weapons to take down the criminal gangs controlled by the current president. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world filled with anomalies, you will encounter various enemies and vice president bosses, each with their own unique anomaly power. For example, did you know the president's PR chief has the power of HEART, making people fall in love with them?! The good news is, by defeating these bosses, you can acquire their anomaly powers! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156330/extras/34fa4ba65a8442fe89c0f243ef28f1b4.poster.avif?t=1755076739\" width=600 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156330/extras/34fa4ba65a8442fe89c0f243ef28f1b4.webm?t=1755076739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>YOU CAN'T BECOME PRESIDENT BY YOURSELF; YOU NEED A TEAM</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need a trustworthy team to run campaigns and empower you on your path to presidency. Choosing the right team is crucial in Anomaly President! They'll be the ones to help you win the race!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156330/extras/39f26a13e780d9cd579b6587cb426a9c.poster.avif?t=1755076739\" width=600 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156330/extras/39f26a13e780d9cd579b6587cb426a9c.webm?t=1755076739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Recruit the oppressed Fluffies to fight for their rights by joining your team. You can assign them to different departments: some will campaign for you during elections, others will upgrade your equipment, and some will assist you in battles. But remember if you want to benefit from them, you need to take good care of them. Otherwise, they might abandon you or worse, lose their lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>YOU NEED A BASE ON YOUR JOURNEY TO PRESIDENCY</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To combat hidden crime syndicates and also run your presidential campaign simultaneously, you need a base that moves with you. Enter the campaign bus! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design your campaign bus to suit your style and needs! Start from scratch, add unique sections, and create a personalized mobile base for your campaign.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156330/extras/32ef5deca71091727ad88854eafc7596.poster.avif?t=1755076739\" width=600 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156330/extras/32ef5deca71091727ad88854eafc7596.webm?t=1755076739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHOOSE YOUR WEAPON AND ANOMALY POWER!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special anomaly upgrades you'll encounter while fighting will shape your warrior identity. You can become a sword master who parries enemies at the right time or transform into a cyber mage dealing mass damage with anomaly powers. In Anomaly President, the choices are plenty! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The best part is, the rogue-like structure lets you experiment with all options. Try out different powers and progress with the one that best suits your style! There are many ways to evolve in Anomaly President. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156330/extras/5fa4f11009c5ed8a89d11462d0e858b5.poster.avif?t=1755076739\" width=600 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156330/extras/5fa4f11009c5ed8a89d11462d0e858b5.webm?t=1755076739\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ANOMALY PRESIDENT WANTS YOU!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel the country, explore new horizons, win the people's hearts, destroy the current president's gangs, liberate the people from tyranny, and ultimately get your revenge! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anomaly President is calling you to action!</p>","developers":["Phew Phew Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3156330/header.jpg?t=1755076739","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3156330/856171711/1be269ac0cdbe900334e0334b262096adaa2a44e/1750875978/dash_av1.mpd?t=1747309710","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3156330/856171711/1be269ac0cdbe900334e0334b262096adaa2a44e/1750875978/dash_h264.mpd?t=1747309710","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"h